  "text": "You stand before a door carved with ancient symbols, its surface warm to the touch. A soft chime echoes from within, as if the room itself is breathing. The air hums with quiet anticipation. Welcome, traveler. The puzzle begins the moment you step inside. No keys, no clues—just your mind, your courage, and the whisper of a story waiting to be uncovered. The door seals behind you. The game has begun."
